'''The International 2016''' was the fourth Major of the 2016 season and the sixth annual edition of '''The International'''. The tournament was hosted in Seattle for the fifth consecutive year; it was the third consecutive year that the Main Event took place at KeyArena, a multi-purpose arena in Seattle Center with a total seating capacity of over 17,000.

==Format==
*'''Open Qualifiers''' - ''June 21st - June 24th, 2016''
**Eight Regional Single-elimination Open Qualifiers, two brackets for each region.
***The winners of each Regional Qualifier will advance to the respective Main Qualifier.
*'''Main Qualifiers''' - ''June 25th - June 28th, 2016''
**Four Regional Qualifiers.
***One group, with the winner advancing directly to The International.
***Second through fifth place teams advance to the Regional Double-elimination Playoff Bracket.
***The winner of each Regional Playoff Bracket will join the six directly invited teams in Seattle.
***Third-place teams will advance to the Wild Card round in Seattle.
*'''Wild Card''' - ''August 2nd, 2016''
**Four team double-elimination bracket.
***Top two teams advance to group stage.
***Bottom two teams are eliminated.	
***All matches are best of three.
*'''Group Stage''' - ''August 3rd - August 5th, 2016''
**Two groups of eight teams.
***Teams play every other team in their group in a best of 2	
***Top four teams in each group advance to upper bracket of the Main Event.
***Bottom four teams in each group advance to lower bracket of the Main Event.
*'''Main Event''' - ''August 8th - August 13th, 2016''
**Sixteen teams play in a double elimination format over six days.	
***Eight teams begin in the upper bracket, eight in the lower bracket.
***First lower bracket game is best of one, Grand Finals are best of five, all others are best of three.

